# Jackdaw Savior also triggers when another creature you control with flying dies (CR 603.10a), and "lesser" is measured against THAT creature's mana
# value, not the Savior's: Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills Bot1's Suntail Hawk (mana value 1), so of the Memnite (0) and Grizzly Bears (2) in the graveyard only
# the Memnite is a legal target. It returns; the Savior stays on the battlefield.

